PROTECTED INVENTIONS:
  1. SHA-512 as leaf hash in KangarooTwelve tree (proven security reduction)
  2. Sentinel Break (0xFFFFFFFF) domain separation between SHA-512 and K12
  3. Truncation native to XOF squeeze: no post-hoc truncation
  4. First verified K12 implementation on 8-bit MCU with NASA-10+ compliance
  5. Zero-heap streaming SHA-512 on 128-byte W schedule stack
